### Local - Home
GET http://localhost:8080/


### Local - Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts


### Local - Get Bob Doe by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/69f622c83a482f0f5090187c


### Local - Get Jane Smith by ID
