### Local - Create new contact
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ashley",
  "lastName": "Weaver",
  "email": "ashley.weaver@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "purple",
  "birthday": "08/17/1995"
}


### Local - Update contact
### Replace the ID below with the ID returned from the POST request for creating new contact, or another real contact ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/contacts/PUT_CONTACT_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ashley",
  "lastName": "Weaver",
  "email": "ashley.updated@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "green",
  "birthday": "08/17/1995"
}


### Local - Delete contact
### Replace the ID below with the ID returned from the POST request for creating new contact, or another real contact ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/contacts/PUT_CONTACT_ID_HERE


